@page "/support"
@model TippSendApp.Pages.Support.IndexModel
@{ViewData["Title"]="Delivery help";}
<main id="main-content" class="pilot-wrap pilot-hero"><div class="pilot-kicker">Clear answers, before collection</div><h1>Delivery help.</h1><p class="pilot-lead">Contact <a href="mailto:contact@tippsend.ie">contact@tippsend.ie</a> with your request or order reference.</p><div class="pilot-grid" style="align-items:start;margin-top:36px"><div class="pilot-panel"><h2>How does pricing work?</h2><p class="pilot-note">Scheduled delivery uses the price on an available departure. Separate trips are quoted based on time, distance and handling. We agree the full price before you accept.</p><h2>When do you operate?</h2><p class="pilot-note">We are starting with Saturday and Sunday deliveries. Choose an available scheduled run or request a quote for a separate trip. We confirm availability before accepting your request.</p><h2>Is my request confirmed?</h2><p class="pilot-note">No. The request form takes no payment. We review the addresses and item, then agree availability, price and arrangements before accepting the delivery.</p></div><div class="pilot-panel"><h2>Can I send between two homes?</h2><p class="pilot-note">Yes. Use “Send an Item” for collection and delivery between two homes, or between a home and a business. The same area and item restrictions apply.</p><h2>What can I send?</h2><p class="pilot-note">Suitably packaged, legal items that fit in a standard car boot, up to 25 kg and subject to acceptance. No cash, hazardous goods, medicines, restricted products or temperature-sensitive goods during the initial service.</p><h2>What if plans change?</h2><p class="pilot-note">Contact us promptly. Cancellation, failed-delivery, reattempt and return arrangements are agreed before acceptance. We will let you know about delays. Scheduled deliveries use an agreed time window rather than an exact arrival time.</p><h2>Do businesses need to pay a monthly fee?</h2><p class="pilot-note">No. Start with a paid trial and pay per delivery. Regular customers can discuss an optional monthly minimum that counts towards eligible delivery charges.</p></div></div></main>
